# GitHub Personal Access Token for automated GitHub Releases publishing
# Generate at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Requirements:
# - Classic Token: check 'repo' scope (full control of private repositories / releases)
# - Fine-Grained Token: Repository access to 'SubhamCrid/furina-releases' with Permissions -> 'Contents' (Read and Write)
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here
